\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces {\bf  Sensorimotor Lancaster Norms ratings.} Average ratings for the selected Arm and Leg Action Words. These ratings are represented in three dimensions: Action, Perceptual, and Sensorimotor. The average ratings evidence a clear distinction between Arm and Leg words for action and sensorimotor, and being similarly rated for visual in Perceptual and Sensorimotor. }}{3}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{sensorimotor_lancaster}{{1}{3}{{\bf Sensorimotor Lancaster Norms ratings.} Average ratings for the selected Arm and Leg Action Words. These ratings are represented in three dimensions: Action, Perceptual, and Sensorimotor. The average ratings evidence a clear distinction between Arm and Leg words for action and sensorimotor, and being similarly rated for visual in Perceptual and Sensorimotor}{figure.caption.8}{}}
